r f7. This begins the process of driving the king to the edge, where mate can be delivered with queen and king support.\n\nReason: Delivering checks with the queen maximizes pressure and limits the opponent's options. Q: b2-g7 is a check that forces the black king to move immediately, accelerating the path to checkmate. It exploits the exposed position of the black king and activates the queen aggressively.\n\nAnswer: Q: b2-g7"}
